hJ-qz3vkk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQPtlgb-iaQmeQopnxeoa--C_goKQWkH7kRKrkVjbsVmA&oe=6AFDC446"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "198477324768984", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162743_108416083180856_5143234439450460160_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pQ64K_zXB3wQ7kNvwETPg-t&_nc_oc=Adptkr0cjNoVP5TLtTwbbS4wAXWqx-jPs3uvlOjhUobsr56e16Y5sfghFW6isY0M9XU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRtDUsb9RkhZKrcQ15nad54COgCLWco8ekIKwlPb3vpqQ&oe=6AFDCC43"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ultrawings", "keywords": ["Ultrawings", "Simulation", "Ultralight", "Adventure", "Flying"], "long_description": "In Ultrawings, you'll pilot multiple aircraft to complete tons of missions while soaring around beautiful islands.\n\nFully supports 3DOF controller for a truly unparalleled flight experience!  \n\nKey Features:\n\n- Pilot 4 distinct aircraft each with their own handling characteristics!\n\n- Soar around 4 unique, beautifully-stylized islands!\n\n- Earn money to buy new airports and new vehicles! Ultrawings is a VR game with REAL progression!\n\n- Lots gameplay variety! Pop balloons, race, perform spot landings, fly through score rings, and even perform emergency landings! Ultrawings is the ultimate hobbyist flight game!\n\n- Full English VO support guides you through the game!", "short_description": "Take to the skies in the Ultralight, rocket-powered Glider, Sport Plane, and Gee Racer to complete a variety of missions across an island-themed world!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://bitplanetgames.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://bitplanetgames.com/", "publisher_name": "Bit Planet Games, LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://ultrawingsgame.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_ta